    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334510/extras/e96863ce2bcd35e3ca6adb4274edd257.avif?t=1733514761\" width=548 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find cute cats in  Buttonwood Street. Can you find them all? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meow Meow...Kittens are calling you\uff01</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334510/extras/5c8fc566f8c5110625acc4ef520b19d0.avif?t=1733514761\" width=548 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Hand drawn cartoon minimalist style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 There are more than 500 cats here</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Find cats to color the scene</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Explore Buttonwood Street</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Some interesting interactive elements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Sounds of cats can help you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Drag and zoom the screen view</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Relax and find all the cats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334510/extras/ffddc61dfd271b30b732b1fc3874a11c.avif?t=1733514761\" width=548 height=180 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334510/extras/e96863ce2bcd35e3ca6adb4274edd257.avif?t=1733514761\" width=548 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find cute cats in  Buttonwood Street. Can you find them all? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meow Meow...Kittens are calling you\uff01</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334510/extras/5c8fc566f8c5110625acc4ef520b19d0.avif?t=1733514761\" width=548 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Hand drawn cartoon minimalist style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 There are more than 500 cats here</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Find cats to color the scene</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Explore Buttonwood Street</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Some interesting interactive elements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Sounds of cats can help you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Drag and zoom the screen view</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Relax and find all the cats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334510/extras/ffddc61dfd271b30b732b1fc3874a11c.avif?t=1733514761\" width=548 height=180 /></span></p>",
